WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,180
There is actually such a large piece of grassland

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,680
There are also mountains and forests

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,680
There will be no shortage of firewood from now on

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:13,470
It seems there is something behind the mountain

5
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,970
I just can't get in now

6
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:17,800
The air in the space seems to have changed too

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,800
Isn’t this upgrade just about expanding the area?

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:29,660
Mumu didn't sleep

9
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,600
Mumu came in

10
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:38,460
If you can feed animals

11
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,960
Then I can raise chickens and ducks in the space
